  "<span class=\"c-accent\">u = ({@0}; {@1})</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">n = ({@2}; {@3})</span><br>p: x = {@4}, y = {@5}, t ∈ R<br>všeobecná rovnica: {@6} = 0 · {@7}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">u = ({@0}; {@1})</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">n = ({@2}; {@3})</span><br>p: x = {@4}, y = {@5}, t ∈ R<br>일반형: {@6} = 0 · {@7}",
  "A trikrát, N dvakrát, S raz": "A 세 번, N 두 번, S 한 번",
